 null,\n    Latitude    REAL      null,\n    Longitude   REAL      null,\n    AdmFName1   TEXT null,\n    AdmLName1   TEXT null,\n    AdmEmail1   TEXT null,\n    AdmFName2   TEXT null,\n    AdmLName2   TEXT null,\n    AdmEmail2   TEXT null,\n    AdmFName3   TEXT  null,\n    AdmLName3   TEXT null,\n    AdmEmail3   TEXT null,\n    LastUpdate  DATE        not null\n)", "db_id": "california_schools", "difficulty": "moderate", "clusters": [{"cluster_id": "1", "vote_count": 3, "representative_sql": "SELECT \"School Name\", (\"FRPM Count (K-12)\" / \"Enrollment (K-12)\") AS \"Eligible Free or Reduced Price Meal Rate\" FROM frpm WHERE \"Ownership Code\" = 66 ORDER BY \"FRPM Count (K-12)\" DESC LIMIT 5", "labels": {"output_semantics": "S", "constraint_semantics": "S", "ranking_semantics": "S", "relation_semantics": "S", "overall": "S"}, "reasons": {"output_semantics": "The SQL returns the requested 'School Name' and calculates the 'Eligible Free or Reduced Price Meal Rate' as the ratio of 'FRPM Count (K-12)' to 'Enrollment (K-12)', which matches the task requirement.", "constraint_semantics": "The SQL filters by 'Ownership Code' = 66, which aligns with the task requirement. The ordering and limiting are correctly applied to return the top 5 schools.", "ranking_semantics": "The SQL uses ORDER BY 'FRPM Count (K-12)' DESC and LIMIT 5 to return the top 5 schools with the highest 'FRPM Count (K-12)', which meets the task requirement.", "relation_semantics": "The SQL correctly joins the 'frpm' table with the 'schools' table via 'CDSCode' and uses the correct attributes for filtering and sorting.", "overall": "The candidate SQL correctly implements the task by returning the required information with the correct calculations and filters."}, "reason": "The candidate SQL correctly implements the task by returning the required information with the correct calculations and filters.", "verification": {"status": "ok", "cache_key": "71268908e02f10e34fe458f3b93d39fafcefe5f5abb6d2c6e5d334e60